{% extends 'base.html.j2' %}
{% from 'components.html.j2' import eyebrow, cta with context %}
{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero wrap"><div>{{ eyebrow('KNOW THE SCOPE. KNOW THE COST.') }}<h1>Clarity should come<br><em>before the commitment.</em></h1><p>A written fee breakdown makes the decision easier. See who receives each payment, what is included and what needs a separate quote.</p><a class="button" href="{{ url('contact/?interest=fees') }}">Request my written quote {{ icon('arrow') }}</a></div><div class="page-hero-note">{{ icon('receipt') }}<h2>Official fees.<br>Our service fee.<br>Other costs.</h2><p>Three clear lines. One understandable decision.</p></div></section>
<section class="section soft-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div>{{ eyebrow('THE STARTING CONVERSATION') }}<h2>Start small.<br>Understand what comes next.</h2></div><p>Your scope comes first.<br>A service price follows a route review.</p></div><div class="fee-table" role="region" aria-label="Service fees" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Our service fee</th><th>What to expect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Initial move conversation</strong><span>15 minutes</span></td><td class="fee-value">Free</td><td>Your priorities, timeline and next useful questions.</td></tr>{% for key,label,text in [('visa','Visa application coordination','Route, document and service scope reviewed first.'),('landing','Arrival & settling-in support','A scope around your accommodation and practical priorities.'),('care','Residency Care','The reminders and coordination relevant to your status.'),('business','Business setup coordination','Activity and professional review before a setup quotation.')] %}<tr><td><strong>{{ label }}</strong></td><td><span data-fee="{{ key }}">Written quote</span></td><td>{{ text }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div><p class="fee-caption">Confirmed service prices are supplied in your written quote. Official fees and third-party services are additional unless the scope says they are included.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap related-grid"><article class="related-card"><span class="eyebrow">01 / OFFICIAL FEES</span><h2>The authority’s fee.</h2><p>Visa, membership, registration and other official fees belong on their own line. Verify the current amount and payment recipient for your route.</p></article><article class="related-card"><span class="eyebrow">02 / OUR SERVICES</span><h2>The work we agree.</h2><p>A named scope, a service fee and the stages of payment. If the scope changes, ask for a revised quote before authorising more work.</p></article><article class="related-card"><span class="eyebrow">03 / THIRD PARTIES</span><h2>The other costs.</h2><p>Translation, insurance, legal review and property costs should be identified separately. Know who provides the service and whose terms apply.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section soft-section"><div class="wrap narrow">{{ eyebrow('BEFORE YOU PAY') }}<h2>Keep these questions<br>in the conversation.</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>{{ icon('check') }} What is included, and what is excluded?</li><li>{{ icon('check') }} Which fees are paid to an authority or another provider?</li><li>{{ icon('check') }} Who handles each stage, and what do I need to supply?</li><li>{{ icon('check') }} What happens if plans change or an application is refused?</li><li>{{ icon('check') }} Which cancellation or refund terms apply to each payment?</li></ul><p>There is no blanket refund promise. Have the relevant cancellation and refund terms in writing before paying.</p></div></section>{{ cta() }}
{% endblock %}

